    "A payment verifier also receives the public request, price and prior spending. Successful requests can reveal a lower bound on your budget. ZK does not hide public payments or encrypt the text sent to a provider.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A payment verifier also receives the public request, price and prior spending. Successful requests can reveal a lower bound on your budget. ZK does not hide public payments or encrypt the text sent to a provider."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "決済の検証者は依頼・料金・支出済み額も受け取ります。成功した依頼から予算の下限が推測される場合があります。ZKは公開された支払いを隠したり、提供者への文章を暗号化したりするものではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
