    },
    "Voice wake keeps the microphone on while this app is open. Say こんにちは to open the eyes and start camera tracking. Other speech is discarded. Choose Stop voice wake, leave the app, or remove the stand to stop listening.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice wake keeps the microphone on while this app is open. Say こんにちは to open the eyes and start camera tracking. Other speech is discarded. Choose Stop voice wake, leave the app, or remove the stand to stop listening."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "声の待受け中は、このアプリを開いている間マイクを使います。「こんにちは」で目を開いてカメラ追跡を開始します。それ以外の発言は破棄します。「声の待受けを停止」、アプリを離れる、スタンドから外すことで停止します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spoken language": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spoken language"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会話の言語"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to wake. Say おやすみ to rest. Touch and hold for controls and settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap to wake. Say おやすみ to rest. Touch and hold for controls and settings."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "タップで起こし、「おやすみ」で休ませます。長押しで操作と設定を開きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet moments do not end our time together. Say おやすみ to rest and stop the camera and microphone. Removing the stand or leaving the app also stops the session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet moments do not end our time together. Say おやすみ to rest and stop the camera and microphone. Removing the stand or leaving the app also stops the session."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "静かな時間でも一緒に過ごし続けます。「おやすみ」で休憩してカメラとマイクを停止します。スタンドから外すかアプリを離れても停止します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap once to wake Mate. Say おやすみ to rest, then tap to wake again. Touch and hold the face for controls and settings. You can also swipe up for controls.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap once to wake Mate. Say おやすみ to rest, then tap to wake again. Touch and hold the face for controls and settings. You can also swipe up for controls."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1回タップで起きて、「おやすみ」で休みます。再びタップすると起きます。顔の長押しか上スワイプで操作と設定を開きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
